From bd36029174b437b38e9e22371dcc4922cc709fdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:18:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Resolve inline SVG references across the document
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Track external sprite targets so an embedder can rebuild only the SVGs affected by a source mutation. Preserve currentColor at each use site.

Co-authored-by: Luís Duarte <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
---
